# StockKart architecture (always)

Work inside `inventory-platform` with strict package boundaries.

## Topology

- `apps/inventory` — compose routes/providers only
- `platform/*` — shell, session, api-client, query, schema, routing (no domain UI except shell chrome)
- `ui-kit` — presentation only; **never** import APIs, session, or `core/*`
- `core/<domain>` — owns `api/`, `queries/`, `pages/`, `ui/`, `routes.ts`, `nav.ts`
- `plugins/*` — vertical extras (cafe) via `plugin-registry`

## Ownership shortcuts

- Scan Sell / stock / returns → `core/product` (+ `productChrome`)
- Auth / onboarding / shops / CRM → `core/user` (+ `journeyChrome`)
- Dashboard chrome / notifications bell / help → `platform/shell` (+ `shellChrome`)
- Analytics charts → `core/analytics` (+ `chartChrome.plot` fixed height)
- Cafe menu/stock → `plugins/cafe`
- `core/checkout` & `core/notifications` are scaffolds — don’t put real features there without migrating ownership

## Hard rules

- Don’t cross-import another domain’s private files; use public barrels only
- Prefer TanStack Query in `core/*/queries`; no new Zustand for server state
- Extend ui-kit chrome for reusable UI; don’t add domain CSS that duplicates chrome
- Read `AGENTS.md` + the target package `README.md` before large changes
